{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Undead Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your team, defend your camp, and fight for survival in this intense zombie shooter. The undead are relentless. Will you and your squad make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Command your survivors</strong>: Tina, Mona, Bob, Joe, Aisa, and Kumiko. Give orders, make tough decisions, and keep your team alive.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Scavenge for supplies</strong> and fortify your camp against the growing horde.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Take down zombies together</strong>. Slash with an axe, snipe with a crossbow, or blast through with a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival is not just about firepower. It is about leadership. Can you outlast the apocalypse? <strong>Download now and prove you have what it takes!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565220?t=1744198004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565220?t=1744198004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565220/42f3b1d21fa2f260446489d1deaed9c823ef780e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744198004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565220/42f3b1d21fa2f260446489d1deaed9c823ef780e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744198004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Partial Nudity: Some NPCs may be shown topless during non-sexual contexts (e.g., showering, changing) or wearing underwear while relaxing. No explicit sexual content is depicted."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Journey \u2013 Help Shape the Future</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survivors Dawn started as a passion project, built using free resources and a drive to create an exciting zombie survival experience. Now, with player support, this could be the start of something bigger - expanding the game, growing a team, and bringing new talent into game development. Your feedback and engagement will help shape the future!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Undead Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your team, defend your camp, and fight for survival in this intense zombie shooter. The undead are relentless. Will you and your squad make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Command your survivors</strong>: Tina, Mona, Bob, Joe, Aisa, and Kumiko. Give orders, make tough decisions, and keep your team alive.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Scavenge for supplies</strong> and fortify your camp against the growing horde.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Take down zombies together</strong>. Slash with an axe, snipe with a crossbow, or blast through with a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival is not just about firepower. It is about leadership. Can you outlast the apocalypse? <strong>Download now and prove you have what it takes!</strong></p>","developers":["Uygar Bursal\u0131o\u011flu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565220/0041bc6cc89acb3114fb4001365c84eda9f2e38b/header.jpg?t=1744198004","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119934,"mp4":{"480":"http: